{
  "schema": "plc-task-v1",
  "title": "仓库盘点服务请求的延期保留与取消",
  "block": "FB_InventoryRequest",
  "target": "offline",
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "R1",
      "text": "# Deferred warehouse inventory request lifecycle\n\n- **Difficulty:** Medium (medium)\n\n## Requirements\n\n1. Implement FB_InventoryRequest for one pending warehouse-inventory service request, not a multi-item queue. Initially Pending, RequestLamp, Dispatched and internal PrevCall are FALSE. Update the previous RequestBtn value every scan, including cancellation scans.\n\n2. Cancel=TRUE has highest priority: clear Pending and Dispatched, but still update button history. Otherwise a rising RequestBtn creates a request. Let Request=previous_Pending OR current_button_rise.\n\n3. If Request AND ServiceReady AND NOT Busy, set Dispatched=TRUE and Pending=FALSE for this scan. Otherwise set Dispatched=FALSE and preserve an unconsumed request in Pending. Busy must not lose a request, even when ServiceReady=TRUE. RequestLamp always equals Pending.\n\n4. A held button must not register repeatedly. A button held across cancellation release must not create a new request. A new request may be dispatched immediately when service is available in the same scan. Dispatched means a task was issued, not that physical inventory work was completed.\n\n## Interface Definition\n\n| Direction | Variable/Field | Data Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Input | `RequestBtn` | `BOOL` | Inventory-request button; rising-edge registration. |\n| Input | `ServiceReady` | `BOOL` | Inventory service can receive a task. |\n| Input | `Busy` | `BOOL` | Inventory resource is busy. |\n| Input | `Cancel` | `BOOL` | Cancel the pending request; highest priority. |\n| Output | `Pending` | `BOOL` | One pending request. |\n| Output | `RequestLamp` | `BOOL` | Pending-request indication. |\n| Output | `Dispatched` | `BOOL` | Task issued in this scan, not work completion. |"
    }
  ],
  "inputs": {
    "RequestBtn": "BOOL",
    "ServiceReady": "BOOL",
    "Busy": "BOOL",
    "Cancel": "BOOL"
  },
  "outputs": {
    "Pending": "BOOL",
    "RequestLamp": "BOOL",
    "Dispatched": "BOOL"
  },
